    40	## Every partner of a nonzero doubly pure element is doubly pure
    41	
    42	The zero scalar row seen in the 21 incidence-census frames is structural. Write the repository bordered matrix as
    43	
    44	`A(z, conjugate(z)) = [[0, -conjugate(z)^T], [conjugate(z), C_z]]`.
