    10	to the five orbits of nullity exactly 8. It determines the kernel bundles there: compact-orbit moduli, stabilizer
    11	representations, transition data, equivalence classes, and how each bundle specializes into the nullity-12 pieces in
    12	its closure. That last part is the input roadmap item 6 needs. As before, the aim is to debug and decompose, and above
